{"version":1,"content":"<p>【外洩規模龐大 ⚠️】日本著名遊戲大廠 CAPCOM 剛剛證實，旗下核心會員服務「CAPCOM ID」系統遭黑客入侵，導致全球高達 11,774,247 個帳號的用戶資料全數外洩。</p><p>官方於 10 月 19 日偵測到未經授權的第三方異常存取行為，並已在 10 月 22 日對外公開事件詳情。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.531493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:15:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:38:13.144518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243236+00:00","content_hash":"d847050c54ebf5b8a16e0a7b806c75594e652c0a584f1ce7212626520f6ae9c3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}